### VS Code REST Client 로 oneM2M 요청 시험 (요청 위의 "Send Request" 클릭)
@cse = http://127.0.0.1:8080/cse-mn

### 0) CSEBase 확인
GET {{cse}}
X-M2M-Origin: CAdmin
X-M2M-RI: t0
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Accept: application/json

### 1) 전체 리소스 목록 (discovery)
GET {{cse}}?fu=1
X-M2M-Origin: CAdmin
X-M2M-RI: t1
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Accept: application/json

### 2) ② 도착 기록을 손으로 넣기 (게이트웨이 없이 ③~⑦ 흐름 시작)
POST {{cse}}/LineSensor-01/arrivals
X-M2M-Origin: CLineSensor01
X-M2M-RI: t2
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Content-Type: application/json;ty=4
Accept: application/json

{"m2m:cin": {"con": {"seq": 17, "productId": "A-00017", "ts": "20261104T110500"}}}

### 3) ⑥ 최신 판정 결과 (flexContainer)
GET {{cse}}/Inspection/inspectionResult
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t3
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Accept: application/json

### 4) ⑥ 판정 결과를 손으로 갱신 (AI 없이 ⑦ 리젝터 시험)
PUT {{cse}}/Inspection/inspectionResult
X-M2M-Origin: CInspection
X-M2M-RI: t4
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"xg:inRet": {"seq": 17, "productId": "A-00017", "verdict": "FAIL", "defectClass": "knife", "confidence": 0.91, "inferenceMs": 38, "modelVer": "yolov8n-xguard-1.0"}}

### 5) ⑩ 불량 컨테이너 찾기 (라벨 discovery)
GET {{cse}}?fu=1&lbl=type:defect&ty=3
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t5
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Accept: application/json

### 6) ⑩ 불량 이력
GET {{cse}}/Inspection/defects?rcn=4
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t6
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Accept: application/json

### 7) ⑩ 라인 상태
GET {{cse}}/LineSensor-01/lineStatus/la
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t7
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Accept: application/json

### 8) ⑩ 비상 정지 (그룹 fanout)
POST {{cse}}/lineA-devices/fopt
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t8
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Content-Type: application/json;ty=4
Accept: application/json

{"m2m:cin": {"con": {"cmd": "STOP"}}}

### 9) 재시작
POST {{cse}}/lineA-devices/fopt
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t9
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Content-Type: application/json;ty=4
Accept: application/json

{"m2m:cin": {"con": {"cmd": "START"}}}

### 10) 권한 확인: 대시보드가 판정을 바꾸려 하면 4103 이 나와야 정상
PUT {{cse}}/Inspection/inspectionResult
X-M2M-Origin: CDashboard
X-M2M-RI: t10
X-M2M-RVI: 3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"xg:inRet": {"verdict": "PASS"}}
